) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (nvidia; 580.95.05) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-4160 CPU @ 3.60GHz (4 threads) - 15.55 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEditing multiple blender file inside the godot project or copy pasting multiple .glb files getting stuck at Re(Importing) Assets on a .png texture\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nFor .blend files inside godot project folder\n1. Make folder \"blender raw\"\n2. Edit multiple .blend files inside the folder without clicking or window focus on godot\n3. click or focus on godot window\n4. godot Re(import) Assets stuck on a .png file\n\nFor .glb files inside godot project folder\n1. Make folder \"blender glb\"\n2. Copy paste multiple .glb files\n3. click or focus on godot window\n4. godot Re(import) Assets stuck on a .png file\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[glb_reimport_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23670082/glb_reimport_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_a